  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integral Development of 12 Communities in the Municipality of San Francisco North</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacin para el Desarrollo del Norte de Chinandega (ADENOCH) $214,853 over three years. The project will provide technical assistance and credit to farmers, merchants and youth in 12 communities to increase their agricultural production, strengthen their businesses, and process and market their products. The project will reach 350 persons directly and 1,400 indirectly.</narrative>
